(7435589, 1174878, 117474, '<td valign="top">Had a hard time figuring out the perspective. I thought it was first a typewriter and then a record player.</td>', 'Had a hard time figuring out the perspective. I thought it was first a typewriter and then a record player.', '2016-02-08 06:12:26.000000', NULL, 0),
